<title>USA: CBOE to list Liposome, U.S. Robotics LEAPS Dec 6.</title>
<headline>CBOE to list Liposome, U.S. Robotics LEAPS Dec 6.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Board Options Exchange said Thursday it will list long-term equity anticipation securities (LEAPS) on Liposome Co Inc and U.S. Robotics Dec 6.</p>
<p>Liposome LEAPS will have strike prices of 15, 17-1/2 and 20, with expirations in January 1998 and January 1999. Thursday morning, Liposome shares were up 1/8 at 16-7/8.</p>
<p>U.S. Robotics LEAPS will have strikes of 60, 70, 80 and 90, with expirations in January 1998 and January 1999. The stock was up 1/2 at 77-3/8 this morning.</p>
<p>((Derivatives desk, 3124088750/Email: derivatives@reuters.com))</p>
